  "details": "The default settings are hillariously bad, things like Vsync, or having the chatbox by default for everyone should be a must.\n\nI'm just going to make a small list.\n\nYou can grab the main menu... But for some reason it's disabled by default...\n\nThe menus can have a \"parallax background\"... but they are disabled...\n\nThe mirror should be always on when calibrating, at least by default.\n\nVsync should be enabled by default\n\nAvatar download priorization should be a must\n\nAvatar max render distance should also be a must, even if it is at +50m\n\nThere are probably other things, but I've formatted my PC a couple times and the defaults are truly awful.",
